      "summary": "Fictional recipe testing quantities and syrup steps; not an actual\nStammtisch drink.\nDrink:\n45 mL cranberry juice\n30 mL soda water\n15 mL rosemary syrup\nSyrup:\n100 mL water\n100 g sugar\n1 sprig rosemary\nHeat the water and sugar gently.\nSteep the rosemary for 10 minutes.\nStir the juice and syrup over ice.\nTop with soda water.",
